{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51649","headline":"石镜山（幷序） · 钱鏐","name":"石镜山（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丱岁遨游在此山，曾惊一石立山前。\n未能显瑞披榛莽，盖爲平凶有岁年。\n昨返锦门停驷马，遂开灵岫种青莲。\n三吴百粤兴金地，永与军民作福田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}